  "description": "A rainbow (p,q) torus knot of smooth-union capsule tubes with Julia-trap iridescence over a domain-warped psychedelic field. Over/under crossings break like a knot diagram, and each glass tube splits its white flux core into Cauchy-dispersed red, green and blue bands. Audio drives winding, glow and pinch; display-space trails follow the spin.",
  "workgroup_size": [
    16,
    16,
    1
  ],
  "supportsDepth": true,
  "supportsDof": false,
  "updated": true,
  "features": [
    "audio-reactive",
    "mouse-driven",
    "temporal",
    "upgraded-rgba"
  ],
